B.ajg=new A.kb("Privacy","PACT","Understand what you share.","A practical guide to account information, public profiles and deal activity in Pact. Review the visibility of information before publishing it or sharing it with other people.","",B.ark,B.at7)
B.auZ=s(["Decision tools","Professional discovery","Participant responsibility"],t.s)
B.ajE=new A.df("The role of Pact","Pact provides tools for organizing acquisition decisions and discovering professional support. Buyers, sellers and professionals remain responsible for their own decisions, information and agreements.",B.auZ)
B.awZ=s(["Accurate information","Account access","Permission to publish"],t.s)
B.ajF=new A.df("Accounts and published information","Use accurate account and professional information, keep your sign-in details private and only publish material you have permission to share. Do not present an example profile as a real professional.",B.awZ)
B.avn=s(["User-entered assumptions","Planning estimates","Independent validation"],t.s)
B.aju=new A.df("Calculators and estimates","Calculator outputs depend on the inputs and assumptions provided. They are planning estimates, not an approved loan, guaranteed business price or formal valuation. Validate important figures with source documents and the appropriate advisers.",B.avn)
B.axS=s(["Professional engagements","Confidentiality agreements","Transaction contracts"],t.s)
B.ajC=new A.df("Professional services and transactions","Saving a professional to a team or discussing a deal does not create a service contract or purchase agreement. Confirm scope, fees, confidentiality and transaction terms directly with the parties before committing.",B.axS)
B.awT=s(["Relevant reviews","Respectful communication","Confidential information"],t.s)
B.ajM=new A.df("Reviews and respectful use","Share honest experiences and keep reviews relevant to the professional\u2019s work. Avoid private client details, confidential deal information, impersonation and abusive content. Example reviews are previews and do not rate a real member.",B.awT)
B.asR=s([B.ajE,B.ajF,B.aju,B.ajC,B.ajM],t.IL)
B.b2U=new A.N("Does Pact promise that a deal will close?","No. Closing depends on the parties, financing, diligence and the agreements they make.")
B.b3f=new A.N("Where should I ask about platform terms?","Use the company contact details on the Contact page when they are available. For obligations in a specific deal, speak to the parties and your adviser.")
B.asQ=s([B.b2U,B.b3f],t.L)
B.ajc=new A.kb("Terms","PACT","A shared understanding of the platform.","Read how Pact\u2019s tools, professional directory and transaction workspaces are intended to be used. Agree deal-specific obligations and professional services separately with the people involved.","",B.asR,B.asQ)
B.axL=s(["Your current stage","The decision you are facing","Questions you want to discuss"],t.s)
B.ajV=new A.df("A conversation about your acquisition","For help organizing your goals or thinking through an opportunity, explore personal consulting and use the booking calendar to arrange a conversation.",B.axL)
B.arB=s(["The expertise you need","Business location","Scope and timing"],t.s)
B.ajv=new A.df("Specialist help with a deal","For legal, tax, accounting, financing or business brokerage services, explore the expert directory. Confirm the professional\u2019s services and availability directly.",B.arB)
B.aqV=s(["Page or feature involved","A description of the issue","Your account email"],t.s)
B.ajR=new A.df("Account and platform questions","Use the company email shown here once it is published. Include the page you were using, what happened and the email associated with your account. Never send your password.",B.aqV)
